  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Justice for Gender equality &amp; women empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Justice for Gender equality &amp; women empowerment project aims to strengthen inclusive, transparent, and gender-equitable fiscal governance in Addis Ababa by enhancing the responsiveness and accountability of public budgeting and taxation systems, ensuring more equitable access to public resources and fair tax treatment for women, youth, and other marginalized groups, particularly those engaged in pro-poor sectors and the informal economy.</narrative>
  </description>
